# TH-015: Neutralisation calorimetry must subtract prior dissolution heat
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 50g
add v1 HCl 0.005mol
measure v1 thermometer
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 50g
add v2 NaOH 0.005mol
measure v2 thermometer
inspect v2
new
mix v1 1 v2 1 into v3
measure v3 thermometer
inspect
